   "@type": "Question",
   "name": "Why do dogs kick the ground with their back legs after pooping?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "It's known as a marking behavior that leaves their trace through paw sweat-gland scent and scratch marks. Some dogs also kick because they feel good after a good poop."
   }
